{"ts": "2026-11-25T06:52:09.085995Z", "case": "trailing whitespace difference", "a": {"status": 200, "dt": 0.782, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 105, "completion_tokens": 121, "total_tokens": 226, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0}}, "text": "To calculate $17 \\times 23$, you can break it down into simpler steps:\n\n1.  Multiply 17 by 20:\n    $$17 \\times 20 = 340$$\n2.  Multiply 17 by 3:\n    $$17 \\times 3 = 51$$\n3.  Add the two results together:\n    $$340 + 51 = 391$$\n\nSo, **$17 \\times 23 = 391$**.", "id": "chatcmpl-39be025fcca8423cb3529fbb176e02ac", "headers": {"content-type": "application/json", "x-moss-box": "g2a0e48", "x-moss-request-id": "39be025fcca8423cb3529fbb176e02ac", "x-moss-retrieve-ms": "0.0", "x-ratelimit-limit-requests": "120", "x-ratelimit-limit-tokens": "600000", "x-ratelimit-remaining-requests": "9", "x-ratelimit-remaining-tokens": "599898", "x-ratelimit-reset-requests": "1s", "x-ratelimit-reset-tokens": "1s"}}, "b": {"status": 200, "dt": 1.253, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 105, "completion_tokens": 189, "total_tokens": 294, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0}}, "text": "To calculate the product of $17$ and $23$, we can use standard multiplication or break it down using the distributive property.\n\n**Method 1: Breakdown**\n$$17 \\times 23 = 17 \\times (20 + 3)$$\n$$= (17 \\times 20) + (17 \\times 3)$$\n$$= 340 + 51$$\n$$= 391$$\n\n**Method 2: Standard Vertical Multiplication**\n```\n   17\n x 23\n ----\n   51  (3 * 17)\n  340  (20 * 17)\n ----\n  391\n```\n\n**Answer:**\n$17 \\times 23 = \\mathbf{391}$", "id": "chatcmpl-df4e49125a4c4f1ab9ce9d88481ea8a7", "headers": {"content-type": "application/json", "x-moss-box": "g2a0e48", "x-moss-request-id": "df4e49125a4c4f1ab9ce9d88481ea8a7", "x-moss-retrieve-ms": "0.0", "x-ratelimit-limit-requests": "120", "x-ratelimit-limit-tokens": "600000", "x-ratelimit-remaining-requests": "9", "x-ratelimit-remaining-tokens": "599898", "x-ratelimit-reset-requests": "1s", "x-ratelimit-reset-tokens": "1s"}}, "b_cache_hit": false, "same_text": false}
